    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An easy to use application for creating both complex and simple VTubers with 2d artwork. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Easy and intuitive UI - with simple or advanced modes depending on how much effort you want to spend!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Virtual pets to help you interact with viewers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lip-Syncing your artwork to the sounds you make with a microphone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stream Platform Integration (For custom redemptions &amp; reading chat) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Custom scripting!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An easy to use application for creating both complex and simple VTubers with 2d artwork. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Easy and intuitive UI - with simple or advanced modes depending on how much effort you want to spend!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Virtual pets to help you interact with viewers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lip-Syncing your artwork to the sounds you make with a microphone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stream Platform Integration (For custom redemptions &amp; reading chat) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Custom scripting!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Stream Puppets is an all in one solution for puppeteering your VTuber (PNGTuber, GIFTuber), and virtual stream pets. Includes features like Lip Syncing, Mouse Tracking, Throwing stuff, and integrations with your favorite Livestream platforms.",
